  <div class="line l-ach"><span class="tag t-ach">成就</span><span class="txt">招募孔亮：招募孔亮。</span></div>
  <div class="line l-main"><span class="tag t-main">主线</span><span class="txt">前往姑苏渡口→前往客栈选择“立即进入”触发剧情进入战斗(战后莫问/莫弃/元鸣离队)。</span></div>
