  <div class="line l-main"><span class="tag t-main">主线</span><span class="txt">和莫问/莫弃/元鸣交谈触发剧情进入战斗*3<span class="drop"><span class="drop">(掉落武岳枪法/玄炎身法)</span></span>。</span></div>
  <div class="line l-note"><span class="tag t-note">备注</span><span class="txt">旁边的欧阳小桃有额外对话；黄昏时分有2个宝箱可拾取。</span></div>
  <div class="line l-main"><span class="tag t-main">主线</span><span class="txt">前往右侧→前往右上方触发剧情选择：</span></div>
