  <div class="choice"><b>2.有点压抑</b>欧阳雪好感+10<b class="imp">(新主线<span class="imp"><span class="imp">必选</span></span>)</b></div>
  <div class="line l-main"><span class="tag t-main">主线</span><span class="txt">剧情后欧阳雪(主力)加入队伍。</span></div>
  <div class="line l-note"><span class="tag t-note">备注</span><span class="txt">夜晚时分有3个宝箱可拾取。</span></div>
  <div class="line l-main"><span class="tag t-main">主线</span><span class="txt">前往入口处剧情后来到姑苏夜市。</span></div>
  <div class="line l-note"><span class="tag t-note">备注</span><span class="txt">一次性地图，<span class="warn"><span class="warn">记得拿完</span></span>3个宝箱。</span></div>
  <div class="line l-side"><span class="tag t-side">支线</span><span class="txt"><span class="name n-side">猜灯谜</span>：和花灯小贩交谈开始猜谜，选择“华、灯、映、雪”，欧阳雪好感度+10。</span></div>
  <div class="line l-side"><span class="tag t-side">支线</span><span class="txt"><span class="name n-side">霓裳羽衣</span>：和穷书生交谈选择“帮忙”，获得幽冥手精良图纸。</span></div>
  <div class="line l-side"><span class="tag t-side">支线</span><span class="txt"><span class="name n-side">茶摊说书</span>：和说书的交谈选择“听”听他说书。</span></div>
  <div class="line l-side"><span class="tag t-side">支线</span><span class="txt"><span class="name n-side">街头卖艺</span>：和江飞鱼交谈选择“比”；吞天虎=吃三盆后认输，获得东坡肉*1；铁臂猿=直接认输，获得赤铜锭*3；江飞鱼=战斗，获得四品宁神丹/大师注解*1。</span></div>
  <div class="line l-side"><span class="tag t-side">支线</span><span class="txt"><span class="name n-side">百味馄饨</span>：和萧大爷交谈选择“买”，吃掉桌上的馄饨触发剧情选择“安慰”，获得萧家食录(<span class="warn"><span class="warn">不要用掉</span></span>)/二十四气馄饨*1。</span></div>
  <div class="line l-side"><span class="tag t-side">支线</span><span class="txt"><span class="name n-side">姑苏灯会</span>：完成以上支线后自动完成任务。</span></div>
  <div class="line l-main"><span class="tag t-main">主线</span><span class="txt">完成以上支线后触发剧情后来到名剑山庄(欧阳雪好感+20、欧阳雪离队)→往客房走*2。</span></div>
  <div class="line l-note"><span class="tag t-note">备注</span><span class="txt">客房的莫问/莫弃有额外对话。</span></div>
  <div class="line l-main"><span class="tag t-main">主线</span><span class="txt">前往客房休息→前往剑坪触发剧情进入战斗*5<span class="drop"><span class="drop">(掉落血鹰喙/醉八仙棍/韦陀掌/玄火心法、瑶姬好感度+20)</span></span>。</span></div>
  <div class="line l-note"><span class="tag t-note">备注</span><span class="txt">和侯九/李元兴/慧空/慧平/莫弃/元鸣/绝无心/斩无情有额外对话。</span></div>
  <div class="line l-scene"><span class="tag t-scene">小剧情</span><span class="txt">前往洗剑池右侧触发剧情，获得丧魂穿心钉/武学感悟*1、冷鹰好感度+10。</span></div>
  <div class="line l-main"><span class="tag t-main">主线</span><span class="txt">前往前往泰阿堂→和堂外的莫问交谈触发剧情选择：</span></div>
  <div class="choice"><b>1.赞同</b>莫问好感+10<b class="imp">(新主线完美通关<span class="imp"><span class="imp">必选</span></span>)</b></div>
  <div class="choice"><b>2.反驳</b>莫问好感+0<b class="imp">(新主线一周目<span class="imp"><span class="imp">必选</span></span>；旧主线<span class="imp"><span class="imp">必选</span></span>)</b></div>
  <div class="line l-main"><span class="tag t-main">主线</span><span class="txt">和莫邪阁的欧阳雪交谈(获得天羽奇剑)→和右侧的瑶姬交谈触发剧情选择：</span></div>
  <div class="choice"><b>1.叫名字</b>瑶姬好感+10<b class="imp">(新主线完美通关<span class="imp"><span class="imp">必选</span></span>)</b></div>
  <div class="choice"><b>2.于理不合</b>瑶姬好感+0<b class="imp">(新主线一周目<span class="imp"><span class="imp">必选</span></span>；旧主线<span class="imp"><span class="imp">必选</span></span>)</b></div>
  <div class="line l-main"><span class="tag t-main">主线</span><span class="txt">前往客房休息(莫问归队)→前往山庄门口(瑶姬(临时)/欧阳雪归队)→往城外走触发剧情进入战斗。</span></div>
  <div class="line l-side"><span class="tag t-side">支线</span><span class="txt"><span class="name n-side">寒泉铸剑</span>：前往姑苏城和铁匠刘成交谈接受任务；前往名剑山庄(如果身上有寒泉则跳过这一阶段)和欧阳茂才交谈；给他陨铁矿*1，获得寒泉*1；给铁匠刘成寒泉*1；离开姑苏城再返回和铁匠刘成交谈，获得龙渊剑*1。</span></div>
  <div class="line l-side"><span class="tag t-side">支线</span><span class="txt"><span class="name n-side">烟霞剑客</span>：前往樊城客栈触发剧情进入战斗；战后选择“去”，霍长青好感度+20；前往程家村触发剧情进入战斗(战胜获得恶鬼杖法)，霍长青好感度+60；前往樊城靠近客栈附近的霍长青，获得烟霞剑法/参竹鸡丝汤菜谱*1、武学心得*3、霍长青好感度+20；可邀请霍长青(抄书)入队。</span></div>
